@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Dynamic Bill Generation Flow
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Receptionist" as Rec
boundary "Billing UI (billing.html)" as UI
control "BillController" as BillCtrl
participant "BillingService" as BillSvc
database "AppointmentRepository" as AptRepo
database "TreatmentRepository" as TrtRepo
database "BillRepository" as BillRepo
participant "AuditService" as Audit

Rec -> UI: Selects completed appointment, inputs Discount % (e.g. 5%) & Tax % (e.g. 2.5%)
UI -> BillCtrl: POST /api/bills (BillRequest)
activate BillCtrl

BillCtrl -> BillSvc: generateBill(request)
activate BillSvc

BillSvc -> AptRepo: findById(request.appointmentId)
AptRepo --> BillSvc: Appointment Entity (with linked Treatment)

BillSvc -> TrtRepo: findById(treatment.id)
TrtRepo --> BillSvc: Treatment Entity (ConsultationFee=2000, TreatmentCost=6000)

note over BillSvc: Dynamic Price Calculation Engine:\nSubtotal = consultationFee + treatmentCost (8000.00)\nDiscountAmount = Subtotal * (discountPct / 100) = 400.00\nTaxableAmount = Subtotal - DiscountAmount = 7600.00\nTaxAmount = TaxableAmount * (taxPct / 100) = 190.00\nTotalAmount = TaxableAmount + TaxAmount = 7790.00

BillSvc -> BillSvc: generateNextBillNumber() -> "BILL-2026-000002"
BillSvc -> BillRepo: save(newBill)
activate BillRepo
BillRepo --> BillSvc: persistedBill
deactivate BillRepo

BillSvc -> Audit: log("receptionist", "GENERATE", "BILL", "BILL-2026-000002")

BillSvc --> BillCtrl: BillResponse DTO
BillCtrl --> UI: 201 Created (BillResponse JSON)
UI --> Rec: Render Itemized Invoice Preview
deactivate BillSvc
deactivate BillCtrl
@enduml
